          "items": [
            "Home Highlights:<br>- Gulf Views<br>- Private Resort-Style Pool and Spa (Pool can be heated for an additional $50 per day between Oct 1 - May 1)<br>- Complimentary beach setups include 2 chairs and 1 umbrella - Service provided Mar 1-Oct 31<br>- Elevator<br>- 6 Seater Golf Cart Included<br>- 6 Adult Bicycles Included<br>- New Construction<br>- Short Walk to the Beach<br><br>Welcome to Emerald Palms, a stunning, newly constructed vacation home in Inlet Beach with breathtaking Gulf views. This luxurious property comfortably sleeps 28 guests across three spacious floors. Highlights include a private, resort-style pool and spa (with heating available), an elevator for convenience, a 6-seater golf cart, and six adult bicycles. Enjoy complimentary beach setups from March to October, and relax on expansive balconies with sweeping views. Located just a short walk from the beach, Emerald Palms offers the perfect blend of elegance and coastal charm for large gatherings.<br><br>The sleeping arrangements at Emerald Palms are designed to offer comfort and luxury for large groups. On the 1st floor, you'll find a Queen over Queen bunk and a Twin over Twin bunk, ideal for younger guests, along with a cozy Junior King suite featuring a private bathroom. The 2nd floor includes another Junior King suite and a Queen over Queen bunk room, perfect for extra flexibility. The 3rd floor is highlighted by a luxurious King master suite with a separate shower and tub, accompanied by two more King rooms, each with their own Twin over Twin bunks. Together, these arrangements ensure ample space and privacy for up to 28 guests.<br><br>Inlet Beach, located on the eastern edge of Florida’s scenic Highway 30A, is a quiet, upscale coastal community known for its pristine, sugar-white beaches and turquoise waters. It offers a more tranquil atmosphere compared to neighboring beach towns, making it perfect for relaxation. Visitors enjoy outdoor activities like paddleboarding, biking, and exploring nearby state parks. Inlet Beach also boasts trendy boutiques, fine dining, and easy access to the larger Panama City Beach area. Its blend of natural beauty and modern amenities makes it a coveted destination along 30A.<br><br>Sleeping Arrangements<br>1st Floor <br>Queen over Queen Bunk & 1 Twin over Twin bunk w/ Shared bathroom with Shower only<br>Junior King Master with Shower Only<br> <br>2nd Floor<br>Junior King with Shower only<br>Queen over Queen Bunks with Shower only<br>1/2 bath<br><br>3rd Floor<br>King Master with Shower and Tub separate<br>King room w/ Twin over Twin Bunk with Shower only<br>King room w/ Twin over Twin Bunk with Shower only<br>1/2 bath",
